Subject: [PATCH] Add FXIOS-14899 [Summarizer] Move `URLSessionProtocol` to
 `BrowserKit` package for easier network testing (#32114)

* chore: move urlsession protocol to Shared package

* chore: move urlsession mock to TestKit

* chore: fix tests
